1. **Extract Common Logic into a Utility Function:**
   The common logic for adding chunks to the main knowledge base can be extracted into a utility function. This will reduce redundancy and make the code more maintainable.

   ```javascript
   // Extract common logic into a utility function
   const addChunksToMainKnowledgeBase = (mainEmbeddings, embeddedChunks) => {
     if (mainEmbeddings.length > 0) {
       mainEmbeddings = mainEmbeddings.concat(embeddedChunks);
     } else {
       mainEmbeddings = embeddedChunks;
     }

     with open(MAIN_EMBEDDINGS_FILE, "w", encoding="utf-8") as f:
       json.dump(mainEmbeddings, f, ensure_ascii=False);
